libfprint-2-tod1-broadcom-installer (0.2.0~24.04.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fetches the Broadcom BCM58200 ControlVault 3 fingerprint TOD driver from
    Canonical's archive, verifies it against a pinned SHA256, and installs it on
    Ubuntu releases newer than 22.04. The proprietary driver is never
    redistributed by this package. (LP: #2099655)
  * Removal takes the driver back out even when the installer has been run more
    than once.

 -- Daniel Iwugo <daniel@themalwarefiles.com>  Sun, 31 May 2026 20:57:23 +0100
